# Environment variables — never commit real secrets.
# .env in this repo currently only has publishable/public keys, but once you
# add SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or an AI provider key, this file will contain
# real secrets — so it's ignored from here on. Use .env.example as the template.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

